:: dock default speaker=narrator
! immediate ring_bell()
> speaker=pilot @dock_greeting
  Fog on the river again. The ferry leaves when the bell stops.
  ? requires=(has_cargo(lantern)) @dock_lantern
    Hold up the lantern so the pilot can see the gangway.
    -> scenes/deck.recite::deck
  ? @dock_ledger
    Ask the clerk to check the passenger ledger first.
    -> scenes/office.recite::office
